# --- Unity stub project ---
# The Assemblies folder is filled by the CopyToUnity build step with Valheim's,
# BepInEx's and Jotunn's DLLs. Valheim's are the game's copyrighted code and
# must not be pushed to GitHub; all of them are regenerated on every build.
JotunnModStubUnity/Assets/Assemblies/*.dll
JotunnModStubUnity/Assets/Assemblies/*.pdb
JotunnModStubUnity/Assets/Assemblies/*.mdb
JotunnModStubUnity/[Ll]ibrary/
JotunnModStubUnity/[Tt]emp/
JotunnModStubUnity/[Ll]ogs/
JotunnModStubUnity/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
JotunnModStubUnity/[Bb]uild/
